
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. INTEREST.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01 BALANCE-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
       01 ANNUAL-RATE    PIC 9(3)V99.
       01 INTEREST-AMT  PIC 9(7)V99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.

           DISPLAY "ENTER BALANCE:"
           ACCEPT BALANCE-AMOUNT

           DISPLAY "ENTER ANNUAL INTEREST RATE:"
           ACCEPT ANNUAL-RATE

           COMPUTE INTEREST-AMT ROUNDED =
               (BALANCE-AMOUNT * ANNUAL-RATE) / 1200

           DISPLAY "MONTHLY INTEREST: "
                   INTEREST-AMT

           STOP RUN.
